sequenceDiagram
    actor Master as App Master
    participant MasterUI as App Master Advanced
    participant BuilderSDK as Builder WalletSdk
    participant BuilderSecure as Builder Protected Storage
    participant MasterSDK as App Master WalletSdk
    participant MasterSecure as App Master Protected Storage
    participant Crypto as Configuration Crypto
    participant Horizon as Horizon Endpoint

    Master->>MasterUI: Enter NOWNodes endpoint and API key
    MasterUI->>MasterSDK: saveAppMasterProviderConfiguration(input)
    MasterSDK->>Horizon: Health check candidate configuration
    Horizon-->>MasterSDK: Healthy response
    MasterSDK->>MasterSecure: Commit protected configuration
    MasterSDK-->>MasterUI: Safe status and configuration version
    MasterUI-->>Master: Clear key field and show ready
    BuilderSDK->>BuilderSecure: Create and store device configuration identity
    BuilderSecure-->>BuilderSDK: Device ID and public encryption key
    BuilderSDK-->>MasterSDK: Activation request QR with device binding
    MasterSDK->>MasterSecure: Read provider configuration
    MasterSecure-->>MasterSDK: Endpoint, headers, and configuration version
    MasterSDK->>Crypto: Encrypt configuration for Builder device
    Crypto-->>MasterSDK: Device-bound ciphertext
    MasterSDK->>MasterSDK: Authorize response and bind request, device, expiry, version
    MasterSDK-->>BuilderSDK: Activation response QR
    BuilderSDK->>BuilderSDK: Verify authorization and device binding
    BuilderSDK->>BuilderSecure: Read device configuration identity
    BuilderSecure-->>BuilderSDK: Protected decryption handle
    BuilderSDK->>Crypto: Decrypt candidate configuration
    Crypto-->>BuilderSDK: Candidate endpoint and provider headers
    BuilderSDK->>Horizon: Health check with candidate configuration
    Horizon-->>BuilderSDK: Healthy response
    BuilderSDK->>BuilderSecure: Commit provider configuration
